      "leadSummary": "**Purpose.** A proof is a finite derivation with declared hypotheses, inference rules and a conclusion.\n**Running application.** An automated theorem-checking service must distinguish proof certificates from true answers.\n**Dangerous assumption.** Do not replace rule-by-rule derivability with the output of a truth-tabl",
